partcad-ldraw
=============

This PartCAD package exposes the LDraw parts library as PartCAD parts.

The code in this repository (the `ldraw_repo.py` repository plugin, the `ldraw`
partType wrapper `ldraw.py`, the PartCAD configuration and the tests) is:

    Copyright 2026 PartCAD
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The LDraw parts library is NOT included in this repository. Category lists,
part lists, part metadata and part geometry (the `.dat` files) are fetched on
demand from the LDraw Parts Library at build time:

    LDraw(TM) - https://www.ldraw.org / https://library.ldraw.org
    The LDraw parts are contributed by the LDraw community and are, per part,
    licensed under CC BY 4.0 or the Creative Commons Attribution License (CCAL);
    the exact license and author of each part are recorded in that part's `.dat`
    header and are surfaced by this package.

LDraw is a trademark of the Estate of James Jessiman. This package is not
affiliated with or endorsed by the LDraw.org team.
